  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be the event that the absolute difference between two randomly chosen real numbers in the sample space <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>,</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p>Now on plotting the diagram we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0070_f8f4ef0b94b7.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>Now from diagram probability is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>area</mtext><mo>(</mo><mi>OACDEG</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>area</mtext><mo>(</mo><mi>OBDF</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>area</mtext><mfenced><mi>OBDF</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mtext>area</mtext><mfenced><mi>ABC</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mtext>area</mtext><mfenced><mi>EFG</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mtext>area</mtext><mfenced><mi>OBDF</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mn>60</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3600</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>1100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3600</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2500</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p>"
